BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Comedian-Jay-Pharoah-Houston-Improv.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2024/02/Comedian-Jay-Pharoah-Houston-Improv.jpg
UID:N1x19Xjjgj0zXFToD1BoJ
SUMMARY:Comedian Jay Pharoah at Houston Improv
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260828T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes comedian\, actor and impressionist Jay 
	Pharoah for 5 stand-up shows over 3 nights. \nBest known for his spot-on i
	mpressions\, Pharoah spent six seasons as a cast member on NBC’s Saturday 
	Night Live. \nIn 2017\, he shifted to his first leading role as Floyd Moon
	ey in Showtime’s White Famous\, which was executive produced by Oscar-winn
	er Jaime Foxx and inspired by Foxx’s real-life experiences. \nAdmission\nT
	ickets start at $37. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calen
