UID:oPa3ke-9xO7J7B1sHE34H
SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - August 202
	6
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260829T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achi
	lles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride
	 days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing togethe
	r riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, f
	ollowed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stud
	e Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually every Satu
	rday of the month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dat
	es. \nPLEASE NOTE: If you are already an Achilles member\, please register
	 by Friday at 8:00 AM. If you are not yet an Achilles member\, please comp
	lete their free membership form here: https://achillesinternational.roster
	fy.com/register \nFor questions regarding tandem rides\, please contact Mi
	chaela with Achilles Houston at 346-819-7465. \nWant to make an even bigge
	r impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipme
	nt\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cy
	clist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fu
	n\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or t
	o volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthou
	se.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \nREGISTER H
	ERE. \n \n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding
	-with-achilles-international-august-2026/2026-08-29/\n\nFrom Houston Light
	house
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-ach
	illes-international-august-2026/2026-08-29/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ccs-houston.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2026/06/Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-Card-Show-I-1.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 6/Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-Card-Show-I-1.jpg
UID:JgQRs2W1Vps_6Q0ISVlLt
SUMMARY:CCS Card Show I
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260829T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:CCS Card Show I — Every Sport. Every TCG. One Floor.\nHouston\,
	 the hobby comes home. For the first time at CCS\, every major sport and e
	very major TCG land under one roof: sports card collectors\, memorabilia h
	unters\, and TCG players moving cards on the same floor\, the way it shoul
	d be. Modern hits to vintage grails\, sealed wax to graded slabs\, raw sin
	gles to game-used pieces. Buy\, sell\, trade\, grade. This is the room. \n
	  \n📅 Date: August 29-30\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet 
	St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 
	Event Highlights 🔥 \n⚾ The Ultimate Sports Card & Memorabilia Marketplace 
	\nExplore vendors dedicated to sports cards\, high-end memorabilia\, and r
	are collectibles from baseball\, football\, basketball\, and more. If you’
	re hunting for a signed rookie card\, vintage set\, or exclusive autograph
	\, this is THE place to level up your collection. \n  \n🃏 Trading Card Gam
	e Extravaganza 🃏 \nWe’re also featuring top TCG vendors offering a treasur
	e trove of Pokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, Magic: The Gathering\, One Piece\, Lorcan
	a\, and more! Chase that elusive rare pull or build your deck for your nex
	t tournament\, you’ll find the best deals on booster packs\, graded single
	s\, sealed products\, and Japanese imports. \n  \n💼 Vendors Wanted \nGot a
	 table’s worth to move? Guest vendors are welcome at Card Show I. The pers
	on across the table is a fan like you. Claim your spot 👉🏻 https://forms.gle
	/sZdrRxHkEXM69kbN6 \n  \n🏨 Traveling to Houston? Lock In Your Rate\nEnjoy 
	a special rate of $79/night — ****2 Queens at TownePlace Suites\, only 15 
	minutes away from the action! 👉 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservation
	s/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink\n\nhttps://cc
	s-houston.com/events/ccs-card-show-i/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-card-show-i/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
