SUMMARY:Jill Scott in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260830T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Jill Scott and her To Whom This
	 May Concern Tour\, with special guest Akeem Ali\, for 2 live concerts on 
	the Sugar Land stage. \nA Grammy-winning singer\, songwriter\, and actress
	\, Jill Scott is known for her soulful blend of R&B\, jazz\, and spoken wo
	rd. \n\nSince her acclaimed debut Who Is Jill Scott? she’s become a defini
	ng voice in contemporary soul\, celebrated for her powerful vocals\, poeti
	c storytelling\, and dynamic live performances. \nAdmission\nTickets start
	 at $101. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing
	 was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with ima
	ges and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organizati
	on\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365things
	inhouston.com/calendar/jill-scott-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre-1/\
	n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
