SUMMARY:Comedian Russell Peters at Houston Improv
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260905T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes Comedian Russell Peters at Houston Impr
	ov for 6 shows over 3 nights on the Spring Branch stage. \nPeters was rece
	ntly named as one of Rolling Stone’s 50 Best Comics of All Time. \nHe star
	ted doing stand-up at the age of 19 at open mics in his native Toronto\, a
	nd spent the next 15 years honing his craft at clubs across Canada and the
	 UK. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $68. Order tickets or learn more. \n \n
	\nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and 
	boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about p
	romoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our
	 channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/comedian-russell-pet
	ers-at-houston-improv-2026-6/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/comedian-russell-peters-at-hous
	ton-improv-2026-6/
LOCATION:Houston Improv\, 7620 Katy Fwy\, #455\, Houston\, TX\, 77024\, Uni
	ted States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
