DESCRIPTION:Sundry Shop Games Double RCQ – Round 2\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoi
	n us at Sundry Shop Games for our upcoming Standard Double Regional Champi
	onship Qualifier (RCQ)! Battle against the area’s top players for your sho
	t at an invitation to the Regional Championship and exclusive RCQ prizes. 
	Strike out on the 11:00AM event? No sweat\, we’ve got a second RCQ queued 
	up at 3:00PM. If you’re looking for a mid-season spot to get an invite\, w
	e’ve got you covered. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 Date: September 26\,
	 2026 | Registration Begins at 10AM\n📍 Sundry Shop Games\, 9700 Bissonnet 
	St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n🎟️ 64 Player Capacity 🏆 Competitive REL \n
	  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent Overview: \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFormat: Standard\n
	Tournament Structure: Swiss / Cut to Top 8\nExpected Number of Rounds: 5\,
	 Based on Attendance\nDecklists Required!\nEntry: $15\, ON-SITE REGISTRATI
	ON\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n💰 Prize Pool:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n1st Place: RQ Invite 
	+ Traditional foil Pinnacle Starcage promo card + Non-foil Pinnacle Starca
	ge promo card + Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\nTop 8: Non-foil Pinnac
	le Starcage promo card + Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\nParticipation
	: Non-Foil Sunpearl Kirin promo card\n\n  \n\n\n\n📋 Registration Details:\
	n\n\n\n\n\nDoors open at 10AM\nEvent #1 Registration Available until 10:55
	AM\nEvent #1 Starts at 11AM\nEvent #2 registration closes at 2:55PM\nEvent
	 #2 Starts at 3PM\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/sundry-shop-games-doub
	le-rcq-round-2/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/sundry-shop-games-double-rcq-round-2/
