 /Launch-Kit-Houston-World-of-Hot-Wheels-V.png
UID:D0-_83034DUAs5NBCa77w
SUMMARY:Houston World of Hot Wheels V
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20261024T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🚗🏁 Houston World of Hot Wheels V | From Redlines to Racecars 🏁🚗
	\nThe weather is cooling down\, but the diecast hunt is heating up. Thirty
	 thousand cars can make a very long shopping list! \nHouston World of Hot 
	Wheels V brings the diecast community together this October for a massive 
	weekend of Hot Wheels\, Matchbox\, vintage pieces\, customs\, racing\, tra
	ding\, and collector discoveries. \n  \n📅 October 24-25 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700
	 Bissonnet St 1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 EVE
	NT HIGHLIGHTS 🔥\n🛒 Hot Wheels Swap & Shop | Both Days\n50+ vendors. 30\,00
	0+ diecast cars. One serious collector hunt. \nDig through Hot Wheels\, Ma
	tchbox\, M2\, Greenlight\, Johnny Lightning\, premium Car Culture\, vintag
	e pieces\, redlines\, MOC collectibles\, loose mainlines\, Super Treasure 
	Hunts\, Treasure Hunts\, and more. \n  \n👶 Mini Zones & Family Fun\nYounge
	r collectors and first-time racers have plenty to explore\, with family-fr
	iendly spaces designed to make the weekend fun for every generation of die
	cast fan. \n  \n🚨 Vendors Wanted\nHave STHs\, vintage redlines\, customs\,
	 premium diecast\, or boxes of mainlines ready to move? Houston World of H
	ot Wheels V is looking for vendors bringing cars collectors actually want 
	to dig through. \n📥 Apply: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \
	n  \n👥 We’re Looking for Collaborators\n🕹️ Activity Hosts → https://forms.g
	le/74Qvuv9PFzeDVF1V8\n🙌 Volunteer Sign-Up → https://forms.gle/15zMGTqZPSGK
	jGdy6 \n  \n🏨 Traveling to Houston?\nSpecial hotel rates are available for
	 attendees traveling in for the weekend. \nBook here 👉🏻 https://www.marriot
	t.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app
	=resvlink \n  \nHunt the cars. Race the cars. Trade the cars. Build a coll
	ection nobody else has. October is rolling in hot.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.
	com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-v/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-v/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
