IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2025/12/Riftbound-50K-Invitational-Banner-IG-4.png
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12
 /Riftbound-50K-Invitational-Banner-IG-4.png
UID:VMRA8--7Wx_YRiYmfUnb3
SUMMARY:CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20261113T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏆 CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational – 2026 Series Overview\nT
	he CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational is a year-long competitive circuit 
	for Riftbound players. The season concludes on November 13–15\, 2026 in Ho
	uston\, Texas with a $50\,000 Invite-Only Championship featuring 128 of th
	e best players in the game. \n  \nLEADERBOARD ↓ \n  \n🗓️ Date: November 13-
	15\, 2026 \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n 
	 \n🏁 How to Qualify for the $50\,000 Invitational\n✅ 3 Ways to Qualify for
	 the 128-Player Invitational: \n\n\n\nQualification Path\nSpots\n\n\n\n\n🏆
	 Auto-Qualify – Top 8 from each $25K Main Event (6 total events)\n48\n\n\n
	📈 Points Leaderboard – Top performers across all events\n64\n\n\n🔥 LCQ Win
	ners – Winner of each Last Chance Qualifier (16 total)\n16\n\n\nTotal\n128
	\n\n\n\nIf a player qualifies through multiple methods\, leaderboard spots
	 roll down to the next eligible player. \n  \n🎖️ Bonus for the Most Consist
	ent Players\nAt the end of the season\, the Top 8 players on the Points Le
	aderboard will receive a Round 1 Bye in the Invitational. \nThis rewards d
	edication\, consistency\, and season-long performance. \n  \n📅 Main Qualif
	ier Weekends – Structure & Prize Pools\nEach of the 6 qualifier weekends i
	ncludes two events: \n  \n🔹 Saturday – $25\,000 Guaranteed Main Event\n\nF
	ormat: Standard\nSwiss + Top Cut\nTop 8 auto-qualify for the CCS $50\,000 
	Riftbound Invitational\nTop 128 placements earn leaderboard points\n\n  \n
	🔸 Sunday – $5\,000 Guaranteed Side Event\n\nOne-day competitive event\nTop
	 8 earn 30 points each\nNo auto-invite from this event\n\n  \n📈 Leaderboar
	d Point System\n🏆 Saturday $25K Main Events – Top 128 Earn Points \nPlacem
	ent Points \n\n1st – 100\n2nd – 80\n3rd–4th – 65\n5th–8th – 50\n9th–16th –
	 35\n17th–32nd – 20\n33rd–64th – 10\n65th–128th – 5\n\n➡️ Total points per 
	Main Event: 1\,750 ➡️ Total points across 6 events: 10\,500 \n🔸 Sunday $5K 
	Events – Top 8 Earn 30 Points Each \n  \n🔥 Last Chance Qualifiers (LCQs)\n
	\n16 LCQ events held leading up to the Invitational\nWinner of each LCQ ea
	rns an automatic invite\nOpen entry — no prior points or placement require
	d\n\n  \n📍 Main Qualifier Tournament Weekends (6 Total)\nAll dates and loc
	ations as scheduled for the 2026 CCS $50\,000 Riftbound Invitational seaso
	n. \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #1\nJanuary 31 – February 1\, 2026 \n📍 Housto
	n\, Texas \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main Event\nSunday – $5\,000 Side Event 
	(Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗 https://topdeck.gg/event/25000-houston-invit
	ational-qualifier-1 \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #2\nMarch 13–15\, 2026 \n📍 H
	ouston\, Texas \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main Event\nSunday – $5\,000 Side E
	vent (Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗  https://topdeck.gg/event/25000-houston
	-invitational-qualifier-2 \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #3\nMay 23–24\, 2026 \
	n📍 Atlanta\, Georgia \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main Event\nSunday – $5\,000 
	Side Event (Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗 https://topdeck.gg/event/25000-ho
	uston-invitational-qualifier-3 \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #4\nJuly 18–19\, 
	2026 \n📍 Atlanta\, Georgia \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main Event\nSunday – $5
	\,000 Side Event (Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗 https://topdeck.gg/event/25
	000-atlanta-invitational-qualifier-4 \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #5\nSeptemb
	er 19–20\, 2026 \n📍 Houston\, Texas \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main Event\nSu
	nday – $5\,000 Side Event (Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗 https://topdeck.gg
	/event/25000-houston-invitational-qualifier-5 \n  \n🗓️ Qualifier Weekend #6
	\nOctober 10-11\, 2026 \n📍 Atlanta\, Georgia \n\nSaturday – $25\,000 Main 
	Event\nSunday – $5\,000 Side Event (Top 8 earn 30 pts each)\n\n🔗 https://t
	opdeck.gg/event/25000-atlanta-invitational-qualifier-6 \n  \n🏆 CCS $50\,00
	0 Riftbound Invitational Championship Weekend\n🗓️ November 13–15\, 2026 \n📍
	 Houston\, Texas \n\nSaturday & Sunday – $50\,000 Main Event\nSunday – Sca
	ling $5\,000 Side Event\nLast Chance Qualifiers – All Day Friday\n\n  \n12
	8 players compete for $50\,000 and the title of CCS Riftbound Champion.\n\
	nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-50000-riftbound-invitational/\n\nFrom 
	CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-50000-riftbound-invitational/
